OL,3,GNEWSATrain attacker said 'I am the
OL,4,Abaddest', trial hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man accused of a mass train stabbing
OL,7,Fwas heard saying "I am the baddest,
OL,8,Fno-one is as bad as me", on a different
OL,9,Ftrain the day before the attack, a
OL,10,Fcourt has heard.
OL,12,FAnthony Williams is accused of
OL,13,Fattempting to murder 10 people on a
OL,14,FLondon-bound train which had to make an
OL,15,Femergency stop in Huntingdon,
OL,16,FCambridgeshire on 1 November last year.
OL,18,FA passenger texted the British
OL,19,FTransport Police reporting a male
OL,20,Fbehaving erractically the night before,
OL,21,FCambridge Crown Court heard.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
